    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little Town Secrets</strong> is a first-person indie horror experience that draws players into the mystery of an abandoned village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a richly detailed and haunting environment as you piece together the clues left behind by its missing inhabitants. With psychological horror elements and immersive atmosphere, every corner holds a new fear. You\u2019ll need to rely on your instincts, light sources, and cleverness to solve puzzles and survive the night \u2014 because here, you're never truly alone.<br><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Terrifying Village:</strong> Explore a detailed, abandoned rural town full of secrets and eerie discoveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> Immersive soundscapes, chilling music, and unsettling visuals build deep psychological tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzles &amp; Exploration:</strong> Solve environmental challenges and uncover story fragments through exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Survival Without Weapons:</strong> No weapons. Only your wits, your flashlight, and your courage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf9 <strong>More Jumpscares:</strong> Increased tension and surprises around every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>EMF/K2 Meter:</strong> A paranormal tool to detect ghostly presence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Head Bobbing:</strong> Realistic camera movement for immersion (toggleable in settings).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude9f <strong>Dirty Window Textures:</strong> Enhanced visuals for environmental realism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdd <strong>Change Log Menu:</strong> In-game changelog menu to track updates.</p></li></ul>",
